    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP.14《孤注一掷》：意料之外的票房黑马 情理之中的电诈共鸣</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64e61f6de490c5dee5465e03</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64e61f6de490c5dee5465e03</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 23 Aug 2023 15:02:05 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>梵一如、关雅荻、曹柠</span></p><span></span><p><span>【影院】</span></p><span></span><p><span>美罗城上影影城</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1099">18:19</a> 【观众互动】这部电影让我想起了《杀人回忆》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1326">22:06</a> 【观众互动】我给各位普及一下，赌球你一定亏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1524">25:24</a> 【观众互动】当时着急看《宇宙探索编辑部》，差点下载了诈骗App</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> 【观众互动】局外人清醒：我的姐妹遭遇“杀猪盘”我看的特别清楚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2137">35:37</a> 【观众互动】小时候我曾建了个女号骗了别人…</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2674">44:34</a>【观众互动】骗术层出不穷，号称自己的警察的电话一定要警惕</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2809">46:49</a> 【观众互动】《孤注一掷》的宣发特别好，建议隔壁《封神》来抄下作业&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2948">49:08</a> 【观众互动】“贪心”与“不甘心”从小就要刻在自己的幼小心灵里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3192">53:12</a> 【观众互动】纯爱剧情太拧巴，现实比电影更残酷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3369">56:09</a> 【观众互动】明明套路都这么老套，为什么还有人被诈骗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3688">1:01:28</a> 【观众互动】模特安娜（金晨 饰）意外落入境外诈骗，我认为其实有更深层次的铺垫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3950">1:05:50</a> 【观众互动】开篇很精致，收尾很拉跨？&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4089">1:08:09</a> 【观众互动】受害者也是加害者，关于跳楼男孩父母这个角色的思考</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lo-Z1XKgGyEztmUCzFFdk8gIWOd8.m4a" length="71738174" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:13:51</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuDY364ogYzuyvmZoNV1ymtUhq1L.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP.13《热烈》：命题作文电影评分不错 只是街舞已经没那么苦逼了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64c8b5d799e1e7669e8cf11b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64c8b5d799e1e7669e8cf11b</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 01 Aug 2023 07:35:51 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>梵一如、关雅荻、曹柠</span></p><span></span><p><span>【影院】</span></p><span></span><p><span>美罗城上影影城</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="947">15:47</a> 【观众互动】单手抛肘竟是王一博亲自完成实力满满</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1188">19:48</a> 【观众互动】看完这部电影我想重新回去跳舞。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1356">22:36</a> 【观众互动】竞技类的题材不需要太多的逻辑缜密，冲着开心就完事了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1471">24:31</a> 【观众互动】有点失望，小白升级太快我看得很跳戏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1789">29:49</a>【观众互动】如果《缝纫机乐队》是乐手们的心声，那《热烈》就是属于我们街舞人的心声</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1966">32:46</a> 【嘉宾互动】Ci总：来自年代的拧巴，街舞比你想象的赚钱的多</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2610">43:30</a> 【观众互动】男性元素太多了，我看不到女性的力量在哪</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2807">46:47</a> 【观众互动】又土又感人，但我看到了很多来自生活的“热烈”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3134">52:14</a> 【观众互动】我快六十了看完依旧很激动，年轻人要多看点励志的片</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3369">56:09</a> 【观众互动】如果电影中的女记者让张艺兴来演会不会很有意思？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3554">59:14</a> 【观众互动】我的小孩原本不想看《热烈》，看完后“真香”了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3786">1:03:06</a> 【观众互动】 谦虚又勤恳，王一博是这部电影的最佳男主演</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3986">1:06:26</a> 【观众互动】本不期待国产电影，这部电影给了我很多惊喜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4213">1:10:13</a> 【观众互动】看不懂岳云鹏在电影中作用，女记者形象像花瓶？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4301">1:11:41</a>【嘉宾互动】史蒂夫：练体育就为了拿奖？跳舞本身就富有乐趣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4621">1:17:01</a> 【观众互动】追寻理想的过程中收获不仅仅是奖牌</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltIRB8_3CBxFyQIBK40h05PcJJKh.m4a" length="77030519" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:19:18</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuDY364ogYzuyvmZoNV1ymtUhq1L.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP.12《芭比》：这样的女性主义“糖水”不是太多，而是太少啦！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64c229ec99e1e7669e277c48</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64c229ec99e1e7669e277c48</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 27 Jul 2023 08:25:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>老圆&amp;文佩（大上海歌舞厅 主播）</span></p><span></span><p><span>CiCi（广告人、Let me CiCi 主播）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主持人】</span></p><span></span><p><span>梵一如、关雅荻、曹柠</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1222">20:22</a> 【观众发言】典型的好莱坞糖水片，潮流不代表改变了世界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1457">24:17</a>【观众发言】不一定要做自己，但至少要有敢去探索的权力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1561">26:01</a> 【观众发言】了解自己是最爱自己的一种方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1907">31:47</a>【观众发言】我筹了八十万拍了一部职场性骚扰的片子，所有人却在反对我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2165">36:05</a> 【观众发言】什么是真正的女性电影，芭比的结尾不过是一场乌托邦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2518">41:58</a> 【观众发言】该被捆绑的应该是他们而不是我们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3078">51:18</a>【观众发言】芭比展现的去性化提醒了我们不要再因性别带上偏见</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3261">54:21</a>【观众发言】爱美不等于招摇，女性主义的音量过度了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3480">58:00</a>【嘉宾发言】史蒂夫：男人为什么厌女和家暴？《芭比》里都解释清楚了。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3746">1:02:26</a>【观众发言】我的爸爸特别需要我妈的认同，我试图也发现了男性心中脆弱的点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4043">1:07:23</a>【观众发言】 封神是父权制有点问题，芭比就是有问题且一定有问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4281">1:11:21</a> 【嘉宾】C总：工作初期我为了塑造自己成为好leader装成了男人模样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4553">1:15:53</a> 【观众发言】通过电影我看到了我自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4783">1:19:43</a> 【观众发言】相比《灌篮高手》芭比最宝贵的地方就是直给了台词</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4918">1:21:58</a> 【观众发言】我把偷拍我的男生送去的警局，如果像我一样遇到了这样的事情，请勇敢报警</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5118">1:25:18</a> 【观众发言】高司令好萌，像极了我的男朋友</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lsTjw3qSac_EKBT5JxzuJyLJDYfN.m4a" length="88335097" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:30:56</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuDY364ogYzuyvmZoNV1ymtUhq1L.jpg"/>
